.net/6f40d550/uploads/origins/7aa9f663-a0cf-4527-a592-6658010aa1b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b989647a81c5c62cdd10b3073cd8306b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f40d550/uploads/origins/7aa9f663-a0cf-4527-a592-6658010aa1b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b989647a81c5c62cdd10b3073cd8306b, https://si.imgix.net/6f40d550/uploads/origins/7aa9f663-a0cf-4527-a592-6658010aa1b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=669d9acc776459fba822574834b0a1c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f40d550/uploads/origins/7aa9f663-a0cf-4527-a592-6658010aa1b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c2f7a33e8a647eb850e24da732a53f8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nMy name is Blanport.\nI would like to make a request because I liked your cute illustration on Twitter.\n\nI would like to request an illustration of Vtuber Toru.\nThe composition and pose of the illustration should be either full of smiles or an anteater pose with teary eyes, as she looks good with smiles. If possible, I would like to have the star symbol at the base of the neck in the reference material on a part of his body.\nI hope this will be helpful, but my image of Toru is that he is basically unhappy, but he is a very serious person, so if I were to compare him to an animal, I would say he is more like a dog.\n\nReference ▼\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5fS-cVwLL6Kxp0i2UPDt5Jwju9ZmXe4\n\nUsage ▼\nWe would like permission to post the work on the Towol fan art tag and for Towol to use it as a thumbnail in a Youtube stream or in a promotion on Twitter.\nIn doing so, we will not change the coloring of the artwork, flip it left or right, or make any other significant alterations.\n(We will mention Mr. Barren's Twitter account, etc. when we use it.)\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SGYmybJ0pFNsSxO/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/92fe0258/uploads/origins/f48c44d0-0e48-4229-9127-4e72f6127b1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f623342adcea16689f53c6e3e27dbc20", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92fe0258/uploads/origins/f48c44d0-0e48-4229-9127-4e72f6127b1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f623342adcea16689f53c6e3e27dbc20, https://si.imgix.net/92fe0258/uploads/origins/f48c44d0-0e48-4229-9127-4e72f6127b1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ccf6f937c5a54500ce95caf84d978f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92fe0258/uploads/origins/f48c44d0-0e48-4229-9127-4e72f6127b1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa59dae6f2b4a53e292d226470ec937b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつも不毛さんのイラストを楽しませてもらっています…！今回ぼっちざろっくの佐々木さんの絵を描いてほしくてリクエストをさせていただきました！もし、難しいなと感じましたらすぐに取り消ししていただいて大丈夫です！リクエスト内容は、背景が桜並木で、その道の真ん中に立って佐々木さんが卒業式の賞状筒を縦に持ちながら悲しげな目で笑っている姿をお願いしたいです…！表情の指定が難しくてすみません！どうか、よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SGYmybJ0pFNsSxO/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a242a5e/uploads/origins/c72a1e9c-36a3-4b0f-8ec4-c6370dee64f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=153837144c60ae2f26058fcfbb9b0ab0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a242a5e/uploads/origins/c72a1e9c-36a3-4b0f-8ec4-c6370dee64f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=153837144c60ae2f26058fcfbb9b0ab0, https://si.imgix.net/1a242a5e/uploads/origins/c72a1e9c-36a3-4b0f-8ec4-c6370dee64f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2266dce53f0b1b525d3ba7d7e5fb86d5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a242a5e/uploads/origins/c72a1e9c-36a3-4b0f-8ec4-c6370dee64f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5899bffdb625b1b9c2e638ad655ae4ff 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。ｻｸｯとしたうちのこのイラストをお願いしたいです！\n\n喉仏が出てるけど胸もある、どちらの性別の特徴も持ち合わせた両性具有っ子のルジェ君です。\n髪の毛は、周囲が赤みがかった金髪〜前髪がちょっと黄色みの金色、というグラデーションがかかっています。\n\n構図は全ておまかせします。\n\nキャラクターのデザインは資料URLのほか、pixivに｢#ルジェ・セルウィ・シュレーゼンロート｣タグで投稿してもあります。\n\nイラストは、私のブログなどに、不毛さんの名前つきで「描いていただきました！」と引用させていただくかもしれません。\nもしお受けいただければ嬉しいです！\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/80507014", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SGYmybJ0pFNsSxO/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33f06dbc/uploads/origins/da75e1d1-be15-4e4d-91cf-ca6ab16b15e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=627adc53608b4b03dab62e88bec99162", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/33f06dbc/uploads/origins/da75e1d1-be15-4e4d-91cf-ca6ab16b15e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=627adc53608b4b03dab62e88bec99162, https://si.imgix.net/33f06dbc/uploads/origins/da75e1d1-be15-4e4d-91cf-ca6ab16b15e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e517577f760b0f47f524bc382e650fea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/33f06dbc/uploads/origins/da75e1d1-be15-4e4d-91cf-ca6ab16b15e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d7a8983b36b7ddecad2c9bc45efcb54 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It's nice to meet you!\nI love your free and expressive fluffy beasts, so I asked you to draw my icon!\n\nI would like you to use my cat as a model!\nHe is a Russian Blue. I would be happy if you could draw him as a little bit male, since my cat is a male.\n\nI will leave the composition and facial expressions to the artist's imagination. Please feel free to draw it as you like!\n\nIf the content does not suit you, you can cancel the drawing.\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ZLzqKsMSdGDEcuVT9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}